{com}. **********************************************************************
. **# 0 - Describing Sports Beverage Statistics
. **********************************************************************
.         
. **## 0.1 - what the data does
.         
.         * baseline wtp
.         
.         * after tasing wtp
.         
.         * after information wtp
.         
.         
.         
. **## 02 - goals
. 
.         * does magnesium information increase wtp?
.                 * compare wtp before vs after information
.                 
.         * are people willing to pay more for magnesium drinks
.                 * product with magnesium vs without
.                 
.         * what drives wtp?
.                 * sensory ratings (flavor, sweetness, etc.)
.                 * preferences (health, sugar, ingredients)
. 
.         * make a frequency table
.         
. **********************************************************************
. **# 1 - clean + understand wtp
